                Demos</a>, can make research more accessible and engaging to a broader audience. While large
            corporations can easily leverage teams of graphic designers and writers to polish their design and writing,
            Ph.D. students and independent AI researchers often lack the time and resources to do so. Clarity bridges
            this gap by offering an aesthetically pleasing, easy-to-navigate template for presenting AI research,
            simplifying the process of creating visually appealing technical blog posts.
